[{"title":"念奴娇 四圣观凉堂","author":"奚㵄","text":"踏破秋痕，向虚堂、细问新凉踪迹。\n野客从来无管领，独鹤自还空碧。\n红日重开，翠华曾到，应恨湖光窄。\n游龙别后，两山依旧南北。\n无语野草闲花，似嗔人问，万事今非昔。\n古木苍烟无限意，只有吟魂知得。\n歌舞百年，是非一醉，未必西风识。\n浩歌归去，满船风雨凄恻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宴瑶池 神仙词","author":"奚㵄","text":"紫鸾飞舞，又东华宴罢，归步凝碧。\n缥缈天风吹送处，泠泠佩声清逸。\n青童两两，争笑捻、琪花半折。\n羽衣寒露香披，翠幢珠辂去云疾。\n西真还又传帝敕。\n霞城检校，问学仙消息。\n玉府高寒，有不老丹容，自然琼液。\n人间尘梦，应误认、烟痕雾迹。\n洞云依约开时，丹华飞素白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解连环 姑苏怀古","author":"奚㵄","text":"霁环新掠。\n正风回浪影，时摇城脚。\n叹天涯、春草无伦，似凝伫当时，柳颦花弱。\n步锦珠沉，谩一眸、千年如昨。\n信龙楼凤阁，无奈都由，笑歌休却。\n斜阳柳边自落。\n听幽禽两两，沙际停泊。\n道世间、多少闲愁，总输与扁舟，五湖游乐。\n便买蓑衣，又生怕、鱼龙风恶。\n把从前、万事对酒，且休问著。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉蓬莱 会稽蓬莱阁怀古","author":"奚㵄","text":"又扁舟东下，水树青圆，雨榴红薄。\n燕子愁多，在重重帘幕。\n杖屧山阴，而今休更问，月尖眉约。\n双杏盟寒，七香珠堕，歌尘飘泊。\n莫倚危阑，怨深黄竹，一鹤归来，乱峰飞落。\n笑色凌波，任雾抽烟邈。\n飘渺生香池冷，湘水外，片云如削。\n昨夜离人，游仙梦远，天风吹觉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"艮山阁 其二","author":"家之巽","text":"一丘兀硉苍虬住，四面森严阵马齐。\n却笑白云无定相，长时逐雨过前溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"艮山阁 其一","author":"家之巽","text":"乐山仁者寂不动，面壁老胡机械深。\n艮背行庭无别义，佛心即是伏羲心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定林寺 其二","author":"家之巽","text":"功名良苦赋归欤，两鬓霜花百念枯。\n钟鼎楼台浑一梦，数间茅屋亦浮屠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定林寺 其一","author":"家之巽","text":"山人当日济时艰，要把唐虞作样看。\n奏罢箫韶无凤至，空教猿鹤怨盟寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定林寺 其四","author":"家之巽","text":"六籍工夫四海名，太平底事竟沉沉。\n裕陵一去何年再，长使时贤泪满襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定林寺 其五","author":"家之巽","text":"老屋三门山径幽，中藏无限古今愁。\n新诗吟罢春云合，塔里金仙笑点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定林寺 其三","author":"家之巽","text":"十载浮云几变更，归来钟阜碧嶙峋。\n早知山色无今古，只与青山作主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三贤堂诗 其二","author":"家之巽","text":"谁称三老作三山，夫子宁居季孟间。\n骆厩侍人多愧色，鳖头处士若为攀。\n辞章小技应閒事，节义千年真大闲。\n何似眉山专一壑，九京贤圣尽欢颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三贤堂诗 其一","author":"家之巽","text":"孤峰落魄一诗人，白傅何曾号直臣。\n较似眉山敢同传，并祠浙水恐诬神。\n人非伦拟终非偶，论贵平和不贵新。\n争似独尊元祐学，高堂正笏更垂绅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"福胜院","author":"家之巽","text":"三过山中寺，劳生有底忙。\n梵书虫蠹纸，佛界燕巢梁。\n晓日光明藏，野花知见香。\n丰碑如会意，读罢更彷徨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次曾南丰韵","author":"家坤翁","text":"忆昔诗豪为写真，至今光景尚如新。\n亭中客鬓几人老，山下灵根千岁春。\n倏歘相逢皆召杜，舂容莫逆少雷陈。\n我来随分重知见，似与夫君夙有因。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金石台","author":"家坤翁","text":"庐陵游乐夕阳山，太守何人若是班。\n三岛幻成一丘小，五峰对峙两溪环。\n竹间庭院邻翁卜，木杪楼台仙者寰。\n紫笑扶疏枝干老，春来得兴颇开颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52802,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日即事雪中见菊 其三","author":"家铉翁","text":"九月黄花正是时，谁催青女试瑰琦。\n冰天雪夜无人问，玉质金相我自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52803,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日即事雪中见菊 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"瀛海茫茫又晚秋，瀛山漠漠几浮沤。\n人间底事登高处，来上元龙百尺楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52804,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日即事雪中见菊 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"怪得西风吹袂凉，客中又过一重阳。\n今年喜见东篱雪，要与黄花共晚香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52805,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人有画花中四伦者偶记毗陵旧诗即题其上 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"扶疏桂树月中生，谁遣人间伴大椿。\n桂欲芳时椿正老，等閒相伴八千春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52806,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人有画花中四伦者偶记毗陵旧诗即题其上 其三","author":"家铉翁","text":"佩玉垂绅廊庙人，幽花小草岂其伦。\n须知四海皆兄弟，淡泊论交处处亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人有画花中四伦者偶记毗陵旧诗即题其上 其四","author":"家铉翁","text":"夭桃艳杏得春饶，涧草林花品亦殽。\n谁似三君丈人行，万山深处自论交。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52808,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人有画花中四伦者偶记毗陵旧诗即题其上 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"万红深处一花王，犹带姚家宫样黄。\n物物有君还有佐，殿春须属召公棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52809,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋日菊盛开 其三","author":"家铉翁","text":"年年菊占晚秋清，今夕东篱放早英。\n月共黄花如有约，花开半夜月偏明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋日菊盛开 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"蓓蕾黄花当径开，朣胧佳月出云来。\n中秋见菊从前少，端为瀛公诗句催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋日菊盛开 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"天宇高寒露欲零，城头月色正亭亭。\n诸公定有惊人句，施与波神月下听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52812,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋月蚀邦人鸣钲救月不约而齐中原旧俗犹有存者感而有作 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"风扫沈阴万象开，断云扶月出阳台。\n万人拭目看天眼，蟆蚀何曾蚀得来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52813,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋月蚀邦人鸣钲救月不约而齐中原旧俗犹有存者感而有作 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"大化周流不暂停，从来息处见其生。\n冰轮万古长如此，本体何曾有晦明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52814,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风雨归舟图 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"前津风色恶，断岸寄孤艇。\n输他田舍翁，午酲犹未醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52815,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"市桥月色","author":"家铉翁","text":"今夜鲸川月色明，卧烟虹影正横陈。\n市桥得月喧箫鼓，堪羡溪桥觅句人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52816,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"何年沧海变桑田，绛阙琼宫尚俨然。\n留得瀛州人在境，故应犹有地行仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦 其三","author":"家铉翁","text":"秋来夜气更清明，月朗窗虚梦不成。\n似报云间仙仗过，分明听得步虚声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪梦 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"天风吹我上瑶京，谒帝通明羽卫森。\n班退归来清梦觉，红云犹自满衣襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西州旧俗每当立春前后以巢菜作饼互相招邀名曰东坡饼顷在燕尝有诗云西州最重眉山饼冬后春前无别羞今度燕山试收拾中间惟欠一元修元修即巢菜之别号盖豌豆菜也东坡故人巢元修尝致其种于黄冈下因得名元修南方有之燕中无此种余来河间再见立春感旧事用前韵 其一","author":"家铉翁","text":"朔风吹我过瀛州，釜甑生尘转可羞。\n聊向春前寻故事，定知食饼记前修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":52820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西州旧俗每当立春前后以巢菜作饼互相招邀名曰东坡饼顷在燕尝有诗云西州最重眉山饼冬后春前无别羞今度燕山试收拾中间惟欠一元修元修即巢菜之别号盖豌豆菜也东坡故人巢元修尝致其种于黄冈下因得名元修南方有之燕中无此种余来河间再见立春感旧事用前韵 其二","author":"家铉翁","text":"我家自贵东坡饼，不为人间肉食羞。\n闻道西山薇蕨长，摘来我可辈元修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":